This one was mostly driven by user feature requests.  In particular,
Jorge got what he wanted ("allow other senses to gloss words with no
sense specified"), and Pierre got some of what he wanted ("Notes for
natlang words.").  This is likely to come as a surprise to both of them.
8)

Natlang words now have a Notes field, which can be used to point to
*lojban* words (not other natural language words).

You can now enter words even if a default definition already exists.

-Robin

